UnitCLFactory::SetDiscountRegistry
├── when caller isn't discount registry manager
│   └── it reverts with NotDiscountRegistryManager
└── when caller is discount registry manager
    ├── when new discount registry is address zero
    │   └── it reverts with DiscountRegistryIsZero
    └── when new discount registry isn't address zero
        ├── it sets discountRegistry to new discountRegistry
        └── it emits DiscountRegistryChanged
